j one line down
k one line up
l right one char
h left one char

:3 go to line 3
gg top of the file
G jump to end of file
M middle of screen
} next blank line
{ previous blank line

0 start of the line
^ first non space char
$ end of line
w next word
b previos word

ctrl + d scroll down half page
ctrl + u scroll up half page
ctrl + f scroll down full page
ctrl + b scroll up full page
zz center current line

/keywork + enter --> n(next) N(previous)
?keyword + enter --> search backwards 
:noh clear search highlights
dG delete from cursor to end of the file
dd delete current word
yy copy current line
yG copy from cursor to end of file
:set number to see line numbers

:set paste in command mode before pasting ctrl + shift + v or right click
:set no paste to turn it off afterwards
>> to indent a line
<< to unindent a line
v to highlight the lines and press = to auto format
3yy copy three lines and paste

Shift+ V(cap) then hit > to indent , to repeat press .
5>> indent current and next 5 lines
